    "kit": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_kit_1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "title": "Engineered lumber, cut to size",
            "text": "<p>Every board arrives cut to length. Wood kits use Grade 1 Southern Yellow Pine, kiln-dried and pressure-treated so it resists warping, cracking and moisture. Composite kits use a blend of wood fibres and recycled plastics.</p><p>6 x 6 beams carry the load, 2 x 8 joists sit 13 to 14 inches on centre to meet standard deck codes, and 5.5-inch pre-sealed boards finish the surface.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "enable_autoplay": false
          }
        },
        "column_kit_2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "title": "Hardware and foundation included",
            "text": "<p>Galvanized, corrosion-resistant screws and brackets come in the box, along with Tuff Block foundation blocks. There is no separate parts list to source and no trip to the lumber yard.</p><p>The deck is engineered for 15,000+ lbs and ships ready to assemble at 15 to 17 inches off the ground.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "enable_autoplay": false
          }
        },
        "column_kit_3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "title": "Instructions built for one person",
            "text": "<p>A standard power drill is the only tool you need. There is no cutting and no measuring on site.</p><p>Every kit ships with step-by-step instructions and access to the 3D instructional app, which walks you through the build one component at a time.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "enable_autoplay": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_kit_1",
        "column_kit_2",
        "column_kit_3"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.multicolumn.presets.name",
