    "detail": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_detail": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ground that is not perfectly flat",
            "class_heading": ""
          }
        },
        "text_detail": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Even if your yard is not level, the deck can be. Cut the posts to bring the frame true, and on slightly uneven ground use gravel or cement tiles under the posts to even out the height. For steeper grades, talk to the support team before you order.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
